{"title":"Career Roadmap · Procurement Executive","role":"Procurement Executive","summary":"A Procurement Executive manages the purchasing process for goods and services required by an organization. The role involves identifying suppliers, obtaining quotations, comparing prices and terms, creating purchase orders, coordinating deliveries, maintaining supplier records, and supporting cost and quality control.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Logistics & Supply Chain"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Procurement Executive manages the purchasing process for goods and services required by an organization. The role involves identifying suppliers, obtaining quotations, comparing prices and terms, creating purchase orders, coordinating deliveries, maintaining supplier records, and supporting cost and quality control."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com – Logistics & Supply Chain graduate, Procurement Executive is a directly aligned entry-level career. The student should combine commerce knowledge with procurement processes, supplier management, inventory, logistics, contract fundamentals, Excel, ERP systems, negotiation, and supply-chain analytics."},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term opportunity is broader than purchasing alone. Strong performers can progress into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Procurement"},{"text":"Category Management"},{"text":"Sourcing"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"Vendor Management"},{"text":"Procurement Operations"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Procurement Foundation"},{"text":"Procurement Intern → Procurement Executive"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Sourcing & Supplier Management"},{"text":"Senior Procurement Executive → Buyer / Sourcing Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Strategic Procurement"},{"text":"Category Manager / Procurement Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Supply Chain Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Procurement / Supply Chain Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce & Supply Chain Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of both commercial transactions and supply-chain operations."},{"type":"h","text":"Core commerce"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Principles of management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply-chain fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Purchasing"},{"text":"Sourcing"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Supply planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the overall flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Procurement","Purchase Order","Inbound Logistics","Warehouse","Inventory","Production / Operations","Customer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Procurement Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should learn how purchasing works in an organization."},{"type":"h","text":"Procure-to-Pay Cycle"},{"type":"p","text":"Master the basic procurement workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Purchase Requisition","Supplier Identification","RFQ","Quotation","Supplier Comparison","Negotiation","Purchase Order","Goods Receipt","Invoice","Three-Way Match","Payment"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important documents"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase requisition"},{"text":"Request for quotation"},{"text":"Quotation"},{"text":"Purchase order"},{"text":"Goods receipt note"},{"text":"Invoice"},{"text":"Delivery challan"},{"text":"Contract"},{"text":"Vendor master"},{"text":"Debit/credit notes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to evaluate suppliers based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Delivery time"},{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Service"},{"text":"Geographic location"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier scorecard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a scorecard using:"},{"type":"table","header":["Metric","Example Evaluation"],"rows":[[{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Competitive / High"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Defect rate"}],[{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"On-time %"}],[{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Average days"}],[{"text":"Service"},{"text":"Response time"}],[{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Credit period"}],[{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Documentation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Excel & Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel is one of the most important tools for an entry-level Procurement Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Pivot Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Date calculations"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier comparison"},{"text":"Purchase tracking"},{"text":"Spend analysis"},{"text":"Inventory monitoring"},{"text":"Purchase-order tracking"},{"text":"Delivery tracking"},{"text":"Price comparison"},{"text":"Vendor scorecards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement Cost Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to compare suppliers based on total cost, not just purchase price."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"Purchase Price"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Freight"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Handling"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Storage"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Quality Costs"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Payment/Financing Impact"},{"type":"p","text":"="},{"type":"p","text":"Total Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly important when comparing domestic and international suppliers."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Strategic Sourcing & Supply Chain"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond routine purchase-order processing."},{"type":"h","text":"Sourcing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier discovery"},{"text":"Supplier qualification"},{"text":"RFQ/RFP"},{"text":"Competitive bidding"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Supplier evaluation"},{"text":"Contract fundamentals"},{"text":"Strategic sourcing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sourcing process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spend Analysis","Requirement Definition","Market Research","Supplier Identification","RFQ/RFP","Quotation Analysis","Negotiation","Supplier Selection","Contract / PO","Performance Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Negotiation Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A Procurement Executive should learn to negotiate more than price."},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unit price"},{"text":"Minimum order quantity"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Delivery schedule"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Quality standards"},{"text":"Penalties"},{"text":"Service levels"},{"text":"Volume discounts"},{"text":"Price escalation clauses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong procurement professional focuses on total value and risk, not simply obtaining the lowest quotation."},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stock levels"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Economic order quantity"},{"text":"ABC analysis"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Slow-moving inventory"},{"text":"Dead stock"},{"text":"Stockouts"},{"text":"Overstock"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reorder concept"},{"type":"p","text":"Demand"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Lead Time"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Safety Stock","Reorder Point"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Supplier Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier dependency"},{"text":"Single-source risk"},{"text":"Financial risk"},{"text":"Quality risk"},{"text":"Delivery risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical risk"},{"text":"Currency risk"},{"text":"Compliance risk"},{"text":"Capacity risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier risk strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Identify Risk","Assess Risk","Rank Suppliers","Mitigation Plan","Alternative Supplier","Continuous Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Procurement Analytics & ERP"},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Com is a 3-year program, compress this stage into the final semester and internship period."},{"type":"h","text":"ERP Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"Other enterprise procurement systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SAP"},{"type":"p","text":"For procurement-oriented careers, exposure to SAP MM (Materials Management) is particularly useful."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material master"},{"text":"Vendor master"},{"text":"Purchase requisition"},{"text":"Purchase order"},{"text":"Goods receipt"},{"text":"Invoice verification"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Procurement workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spend analysis"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Price variance"},{"text":"Purchase-price variance"},{"text":"Savings analysis"},{"text":"Category analysis"},{"text":"Lead-time analysis"},{"text":"Purchase-order cycle time"},{"text":"On-time delivery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"KPIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Important procurement KPIs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost savings"},{"text":"Purchase price variance"},{"text":"Supplier on-time delivery"},{"text":"Defect rate"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"PO cycle time"},{"text":"Contract compliance"},{"text":"Spend under management"},{"text":"Supplier concentration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Power BI to create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Total Spend"},{"type":"p","text":"Supplier Spend"},{"type":"p","text":"Category Spend"},{"type":"p","text":"Savings"},{"type":"p","text":"Price Variance"},{"type":"p","text":"On-Time Delivery"},{"type":"p","text":"Supplier Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Open POs"},{"type":"p","text":"Overdue POs"},{"type":"p","text":"This can significantly strengthen an entry-level profile."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Digital Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand emerging procurement technologies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-procurement"},{"text":"Supplier portals"},{"text":"Procurement automation"},{"text":"Electronic purchase orders"},{"text":"Digital contracts"},{"text":"Spend analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted sourcing"},{"text":"Automated invoice matching"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Supplier Comparison System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Power BI solution comparing suppliers based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Total cost"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Generate a supplier recommendation."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Procurement Spend Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze historical procurement data by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Month"},{"text":"Product"},{"text":"Spend"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Vendor Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"On-time delivery"},{"text":"Defect rate"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Price variance"},{"text":"PO fulfillment"},{"text":"Complaint rate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a supplier scorecard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Inventory Reorder Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"EOQ"},{"text":"Stockout risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — End-to-End Procurement Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Purchase Requisition","Supplier Search","RFQ","Quotation Comparison","Negotiation","Supplier Selection","Purchase Order","Goods Receipt","Invoice","Three-Way Match","Payment","Supplier Performance"]},{"type":"p","text":"This should become the student's primary portfolio project."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement Intern"},{"text":"Purchasing Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Intern"},{"text":"Sourcing Intern"},{"text":"Vendor Management Intern"},{"text":"Logistics Intern"},{"text":"Operations Intern"},{"text":"Procurement Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant industries"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Healthcare"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A procurement internship involving supplier interaction, RFQs, purchase orders, ERP systems, spend analysis, and inventory is especially valuable."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement Executive"},{"text":"Procurement Associate"},{"text":"Purchasing Executive"},{"text":"Purchasing Associate"},{"text":"Procurement Coordinator"},{"text":"Buyer"},{"text":"Junior Buyer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Executive"},{"text":"Supply Chain Coordinator"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Logistics Executive"},{"text":"Operations Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sourcing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sourcing Executive"},{"text":"Sourcing Analyst"},{"text":"Vendor Management Executive"},{"text":"Supplier Relationship Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"With stronger analytical skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement Analyst"},{"text":"Spend Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Procurement Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Purchasing"},{"text":"Procurement process"}],[{"text":"Supplier selection"},{"text":"Sourcing"}],[{"text":"RFQ/RFP"},{"text":"Procurement documentation"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Commercial negotiation"}],[{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Supplier performance"}],[{"text":"Cost reduction"},{"text":"Spend analysis"}],[{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Inventory management"}],[{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"SAP/Oracle/Dynamics"}],[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Excel"}],[{"text":"Dashboarding"},{"text":"Power BI"}],[{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"ERP/procurement systems"}],[{"text":"Invoice processing"},{"text":"Three-way matching"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Supply-chain fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Supplier-risk management"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Vendor/business communication"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement fundamentals"},{"text":"Strategic sourcing"},{"text":"Supplier management"},{"text":"Contract management"},{"text":"Category management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SAP MM"},{"text":"ERP fundamentals"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Demand planning"},{"text":"Supply-chain analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional procurement certifications can be considered later when the student has identified a specific specialization."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not mandatory for becoming a Procurement Executive."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA Procurement"},{"text":"MBA Logistics"},{"text":"M.Com Logistics"},{"text":"Master's in Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Master's in Operations Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong combinations"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Procurement Executive","Procurement Analyst","Category Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Procurement","Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Procurement","Strategic Sourcing","Procurement Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Strategic Sourcing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier markets"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Category strategy"},{"text":"Cost reduction"},{"text":"Supplier selection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Procurement Executive","Sourcing Specialist","Strategic Sourcing Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Category Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Manage a specific spend category such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Raw materials"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Facilities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category strategy"},{"text":"Supplier market"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Procurement Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spend analytics"},{"text":"Supplier analytics"},{"text":"Savings"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Data-driven procurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Procurement Executive","Procurement Analyst","Senior Procurement Analyst","Procurement Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Supplier Relationship Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Strategic relationships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Supply Chain Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from procurement into the broader supply chain."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand planning"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Distribution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Procurement Executive","Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Procurement route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com – Logistics & Supply Chain","Procurement Intern","Procurement Executive","Senior Procurement Executive","Procurement Specialist","Procurement Manager","Senior Procurement Manager","Head of Procurement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategic sourcing route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Procurement Executive","Sourcing Analyst","Sourcing Specialist","Strategic Sourcing Manager","Category / Procurement Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Procurement Executive","Procurement Analyst","Senior Procurement Analyst","Procurement Analytics Lead","Supply Chain Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Procurement is rapidly becoming technology-enabled."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered sourcing"},{"text":"Spend analytics"},{"text":"Supplier-risk analytics"},{"text":"Automated RFQs"},{"text":"Intelligent contract management"},{"text":"E-procurement platforms"},{"text":"Predictive procurement"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Digital supplier networks"},{"text":"RPA"},{"text":"Automated invoice matching"},{"text":"Supply-chain digital twins"},{"text":"AI-assisted negotiation analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future Procurement Executive will increasingly spend less time on repetitive purchase-order administration and more time on supplier strategy, analytics, risk management, negotiation, and cost optimization."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Purchasing"},{"type":"p","text":"Strategic Sourcing"},{"type":"p","text":"Supplier Management"},{"type":"p","text":"RFQ/RFP"},{"type":"p","text":"Negotiation"},{"type":"p","text":"Contract Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"p","text":"Inventory"},{"type":"p","text":"Logistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Warehousing"},{"type":"p","text":"Demand & Supply"},{"type":"p","text":"Supplier Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Supply Chain Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Cost Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Budgeting"},{"type":"p","text":"Purchase Price Variance"},{"type":"p","text":"Working Capital"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Power Query"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"SAP MM"},{"type":"p","text":"ERP"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Spend Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"AI Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"RPA"},{"type":"p","text":"Predictive Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to manage a simulated procurement cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Requirement","Purchase Requisition","Supplier Research","RFQ / RFP","Quotation Comparison","Total Cost Analysis","Negotiation","Supplier Selection","Purchase Order","Goods Receipt","Three-Way Match","Payment","Supplier Performance Review"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally graduate with one procurement/supply-chain internship, advanced Excel, ERP exposure, supplier-analysis skills, negotiation fundamentals, procurement documentation knowledge, and at least 3–5 practical analytics projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com – Logistics & Supply Chain → Procurement Executive is a direct and practical pathway into procurement and supply-chain careers. The core employability combination is Procurement + Supplier Management + Excel + ERP/SAP + Cost Analysis + Negotiation + Supply-Chain Fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"For stronger long-term growth, the student should avoid remaining limited to routine purchase-order processing. The better strategy is to progress toward Strategic Sourcing, Category Management, Procurement Analytics, Supplier Relationship Management, or broader Supply Chain Management."},{"type":"p","text":"The most future-ready profile combines procurement expertise + data analytics + ERP systems + automation, creating a progression from Procurement Executive → Procurement/Sourcing Specialist → Category or Procurement Manager → Head of Procurement / Supply Chain Leadership."}]}]}